# Authentication

JWT access tokens + refresh tokens. Customer PWA does not use auth.

## Roles (ascending privilege)

```text
BARISTA → MANAGER → TENANT_ADMIN → SUPER_ADMIN
```

| Role | Access |
|------|--------|
| BARISTA | Kitchen dashboard, order status changes |
| MANAGER | Admin dashboard for own store(s) |
| TENANT_ADMIN | All stores within tenant |
| SUPER_ADMIN | Platform-wide tenant/billing management |

## Rules

- Attach `tenantId`, `role`, and `storeIds` to JWT payload
- Use NestJS `@Roles()` guard + custom `TenantGuard` on every protected route
- Refresh tokens stored hashed in DB; rotate on use
- Never expose refresh tokens to client-side JavaScript (httpOnly cookie)
